# Broker role-loop experiment withdrawn

## Status

This unfrozen implementation slice no longer defines current behavior. Its
specialized runtime, role loop, browser board, and policy assets were removed.
The task ledger is retained only as a record of work that was later withdrawn.

## Retained boundary

Only independently owned generic infrastructure survives:

- durable normal browser conversations;
- exact harness-session resume and normalized events;
- transactional outbox delivery and bounded broker recovery;
- generic shell/task/result messages;
- generic headless launch and model-route resolution; and
- read-only Git targets and Diff review.

Current behavior is specified by the normal browser-conversation and performance
documents. This record grants no workflow, runtime, or merge authority.
', 'specs_sc/browser-only-sprint-orchestration.md', '2026-07-30 07:13:48', '2026-07-30 07:13:48');
