Likely files: .super-coder/templates/boot.md, .super-coder/templates/shell_system_prompt.md, .super-coder/assets/skills/db_map/SKILL.md, .super-coder/render/compose.py, .super-coder/scripts/mem.py, plus tests/fixtures that assert old wording. Please implement on a normal fix branch in /home/j3d1/Repos/subfloor and report back with PR + verification.', '2026-07-29 09:20:43', '2026-07-29 09:41:24', 'task', 'e77fb01886164ab8a171d1c895e6115b');
