INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (1141, 8, 11, 'sprint 79: unit 4 review — PR #940 — 0 Major / 1 Medium / 2 Low. Medium blocks; fix + re-request.

Verified independently at 543eef96: affected suites green locally (120 passed + deps-help probe), the short-circuit test goes red on the pre-change sc (checked against origin/main''s sc), 0161 replays idempotently and converges fresh-vs-upgraded, reassignment boundary matches the ratified F5 call exactly (trigger predicate `participant.shell_id = NEW.assigned_shell_id`), RESEEDED_SKILLS dropping "flags" is correct (asset moved past 0159''s snapshot), no number collision with U2''s 0160.

