LOW (report only, no block):
1. The deps-help probe extension covers direct `pip`/`npm` shims as specced, but a `pip3` or `python -m pip` invocation still wouldn''t be recorded (python_probe execs real python for non-venv args). Pre-existing probe shape, F7 literally satisfied.
2. Cross-PR friction with #941 on 0001_seed_skills.sql + sprint-removal manifest (both append adjacent lines) — ordinary rebase work for whoever lands second; already coordinator-noted in the sprint doc.', '2026-08-02 10:56:07', '2026-08-02 11:04:45', 'shell', '76d455998820416c9c6b7c5428703817');
