INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (1262, 5, 9, 'unit-report 86 unit=2 pr=#958
shipped: SHELL_BUSY wake contention now recovers durably through attempts 2–5 with 15/60/180/300s backoff, pauses once on exhaustion, and treats human resume as an episode reset that immediately re-delivers the stranded unread wake with a fresh budget.
judgements: Attempt ordinal call (original failed launch = attempt 1; recovery wakes = attempts 2–5) ratified by PLN1. SC-051 direction (b), human resume as an episode reset with prior-episode rows excluded, ratified by PLN1 and folded into spec #85.
issues: One real CI red at 155c612: the board projection rejected a new episode-reset event name; fixed in the same loop by reusing wake.requeued with classification=contention_episode_reset. Review found 1 Medium (SC-051 resume-after-exhaustion re-pause trap); fixed in one loop, flag #139 closed, re-review clean.
deviations: none
follow-ups: REV2 Low 1 — the duplicate-pulse dedupe assertion scans zero rows, so only the aggregate event-count assertion substantively gates one event per link; consider an adoption-path double-pulse test. REV2 Low 2 — possible future optimization of wake.requeued event rescans; malformed busy keys could wedge reconciliation; non-SHELL_BUSY failure mid-chain remains conformant but unpinned. Flag #136 poll-backoff persistence remained out of scope.', '2026-08-02 15:43:02', '2026-08-02 15:43:31', 'result', 'a6b233c515c7490f934092cd52eaedb6');
INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (1263, 9, 8, 'SPRINT 86: conformance pass — spec docs #84 and #85 (both units merged), main @ 3a89a5d. Judge the specs against the code on main — never the diffs, never the trail — and file four-way verdicts (as-specced / deviated-intentionally / deviated-silently / unimplemented) as a ''CONFORMANCE: Sprint 86'' doc + a one-line result pointer to me. Ratified judgement calls (the only narrative input): (1) unit 2 attempt ordinal — original failed launch = attempt 1, recovery wakes = attempts 2-5 with backoffs 15/60/180/300s; (2) SC-051 resume-after-exhaustion ruled as human episode reset and folded into spec #85''s Edge cases — judge against the amended spec body in the DB. Load the sprint skill (conformance slot).', '2026-08-02 15:43:49', '2026-08-02 15:58:43', 'task', '5da1eaf806e94cb9959335ee17ef1d06');
